flowchart TD
    S[Recorded human selection] --> V[Validate decision, selected option and review hashes]
    V --> P[Read-only request preview]
    P --> I[Immutable strategy input snapshot]
    I --> A[Prepared pipeline with parent run and input hash]
    A --> F{Inputs unchanged and sources current?}
    F -->|No| X[Reject before generation]
    F -->|Yes, explicit resume| R[Atomically reserve one model attempt]
    R --> M[LLM returns internal strategy hypotheses]
    M --> C[Validate schema, decision IDs and exact source quotes]
    C -->|Invalid| E[Preserve failed run, no automatic retry]
    C -->|Valid| D[Durable draft checkpoint]
    D --> H[Human review packet with freshness flags]
    D --> REC[Recovery uses saved run without second generation]
    H --> K[Separate linked critic for all sections]
    K --> U[Human review required]
    H -.-> N[No publication, canonical edits or workflow approval]
